  "body": "Perfectly positioned in the Rangitoto College zone, this two storey, five bedroom Browns Bay home offers a generous 180m² floor plan. Open thresholds and broad decks seamlessly connect the light filled interiors with the multiple living zones and backyard.\r\n\r\nThe open plan kitchen, dining, and living areas feature high spec UV tinted glass to protect your interiors. Designed for entertaining, the substantial island bench, butler’s kitchen, and adjoining dining space keep everyone connected. Timber flooring, wide sliders, a heat pump, and an HRV system ensure year round climate comfort.\r\n\r\nAccommodation offers flexibility across both levels, featuring a generously proportioned main bedroom alongside four additional rooms for family or guests. Two and a half bathrooms, a separate laundry, a rumpus room, and a dedicated study/workspace handle busy mornings and quiet retreats with ease.\r\n\r\nOutside, broad decking extends directly from the living spaces, with a covered section ideal for relaxed evenings and barbecues. The fenced lawn and easy care grounds leave plenty of room for children and pets, while four car parking adds everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet cul-de-sac, Eastwood Rise offers a superb lifestyle with Rangitoto College, Northcross Intermediate, and Sherwood School nearby. Sherwood Reserve, Browns Bay village, and the beach are all within easy reach. Contact Katie Peirce or Jenny Jin to arrange a viewing.",
